{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/d2e592a57fc8c2a5020b65612e61f4d7.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1232 height=424 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this original point-and-click horror game, you play as a young teen whose dream has twisted into a terrifying nightmare. Now locked inside your bedroom, you must fend off your demon and survive the night until your alarm wakes you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that won\u2019t be anytime soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time flies when you close your eyes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/29e4309e8c30016f735b8e02f79a2d98.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/29e4309e8c30016f735b8e02f79a2d98.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by subconscious intent or simple bad luck, you\u2019ve set your alarm for much later than usual. That means you <i>would</i> have to endure several long, agonizing hours. Emphasis on <i>would</i>, because as long as you sleep, those hours will turn into minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But staying asleep that long won\u2019t be easy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trapped with a demon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/e45545e5508f4eb65abf234d6a52860a.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/e45545e5508f4eb65abf234d6a52860a.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying demon, formed from the guilt and regret buried within your mind, is stalking you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its goal: making your sleep<strong> permanent.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a flashlight as your single source of light and the few objects within your room, you must keep it away. Shut it out, flash it, or hide from it, but be warned: if you keep your eyes closed for too long, it will seize that moment to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, you\u2019re not entirely alone. <strong>You have a helping hand.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help can come in unexpected forms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/5933549db804917df8c0c482992986bc.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/5933549db804917df8c0c482992986bc.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Nubby</strong>, a simple plush gifted to help you sleep better. No matter what happens, they\u2019ll do their best to alert you to any new dangers lurking while you sleep.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So with all this in mind, close your eyes\u2026 and <i><strong>Go To Sleep.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477720?t=1758484418","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758484418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/bf637a74bbcf97d546d2e1424f5db160f0254f7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758484418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/bf637a74bbcf97d546d2e1424f5db160f0254f7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758484418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror themes and general depictions of violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/d2e592a57fc8c2a5020b65612e61f4d7.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1232 height=424 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this original point-and-click horror game, you play as a young teen whose dream has twisted into a terrifying nightmare. Now locked inside your bedroom, you must fend off your demon and survive the night until your alarm wakes you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that won\u2019t be anytime soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time flies when you close your eyes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/29e4309e8c30016f735b8e02f79a2d98.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/29e4309e8c30016f735b8e02f79a2d98.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by subconscious intent or simple bad luck, you\u2019ve set your alarm for much later than usual. That means you <i>would</i> have to endure several long, agonizing hours. Emphasis on <i>would</i>, because as long as you sleep, those hours will turn into minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But staying asleep that long won\u2019t be easy.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trapped with a demon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/e45545e5508f4eb65abf234d6a52860a.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/e45545e5508f4eb65abf234d6a52860a.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying demon, formed from the guilt and regret buried within your mind, is stalking you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its goal: making your sleep<strong> permanent.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a flashlight as your single source of light and the few objects within your room, you must keep it away. Shut it out, flash it, or hide from it, but be warned: if you keep your eyes closed for too long, it will seize that moment to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, you\u2019re not entirely alone. <strong>You have a helping hand.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help can come in unexpected forms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/5933549db804917df8c0c482992986bc.poster.avif?t=1758484418\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/extras/5933549db804917df8c0c482992986bc.webm?t=1758484418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Nubby</strong>, a simple plush gifted to help you sleep better. No matter what happens, they\u2019ll do their best to alert you to any new dangers lurking while you sleep.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So with all this in mind, close your eyes\u2026 and <i><strong>Go To Sleep.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Yu Ro"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/079aacba0596a94510bf97117c6cb4213ef9ef5e/header.jpg?t=1758484418","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 @ 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated graphic / Intel Iris Plus / AMD Radeon R9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3477720/1565930010/a4a989429cac8eda9c5754979eb8d34c0354c83b/1755755995/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758484414","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3477720/1565930010/a4a989429cac8eda9c5754979eb8d34c0354c83b/1755755995/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758484414","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai