4418","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477720/1943def80e30fca04be42b0c6267bab47cbd2cea/ss_1943def80e30fca04be42b0c6267bab47cbd2cea.600x338.jpg?t=1758484418"}],"short_description":"What began as a fun dream has turned into a waking nightmare. Now trapped in your room, you are stalked by a relentless demon. You must keep it at bay. Your only way through this nightmare? Close your eyes... and go to sleep.","steam_appid":3477720,"support_info":{"email":"yurogamedev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}